.AT25FF081A-SSHN-B :1 ;The AT25FF081A is a member of our Standard class code and data storage solutions and is ideally suited for systems that need fast Read performance and low Sleep power for boot/code shadowing and Execute-in-Place tasks. Its low power consumption and wide operating voltage range are optimized for battery-powered designs.
